{"id":"emocionante","lemma":"emocionante","pos":"adj","rank":2102,"glosses":["poignant (evoking strong mental sensation)","thrilling; exciting"],"ipa":"/e.mo.si.oˈnɐ̃.t͡ʃi/","forms":{"plural":"emocionantes"},"examples":[{"text":"Isso parece emocionante.","en":"That sounds exciting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/843817","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},null]},{"text":"Estávamos esperando algo emocionante acontecer.","en":"We were expecting something exciting to happen.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to wait","l":"esperar"},{"g":"something"},null,{"g":"to happen"}]},{"text":"Foi muito emocionante.","en":"It was very exciting.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"very / a lot"},null]},{"text":"Tom teve uma vida muito emocionante.","en":"Tom has led a pretty exciting life.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"state of being alive"},{"g":"very / a lot"},null]},{"text":"Eu nunca pensei que seria tão emocionante.","en":"I never thought it would be so exciting.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"never (at no time"},{"g":"to think","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so"},null]}]}